Package: SurplusProductionModelMSE
Type: Package
Title: Management Strategy Evaluation
Version: 0.1.3
Authors@R: 
    person("Alistair", "Dunn", 
           email = "alistair.dunn@oceanenvironmental.co.nz", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "YOUR-ORCID-ID"))
Description: 
    A closed-loop Management Strategy Evaluation (MSE) framework. Provides 
    operating model forward projection, observation and implementation 
    error simulation, harvest control rules, and performance metric 
    evaluation. Supports spatial structure mismatch testing between 
    operating and estimation models using the SurplusProductionModel 
    package as the assessment engine.
